  "text": "The UMN guide recommends removing spotted leaves, cleaning hands and pruning tools after handling infected plants, and keeping leaves dry. It says not to remove more than one-third of the plant\u2019s leaves. The guide also says most home gardeners do not need to use fungicide for early blight.",
